@AddisEats.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5282

### Restaurant search: singular and repeated multi-value filters
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants?area=Bole&areas=Bole&areas=Piassa&maxFeeEtb=60&page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Restaurant detail
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants/1
Accept: application/json

### Restaurant menu
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/restaurants/1/menu
Accept: application/json

### Menu list and detail
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menu?category=Main
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menu/1
Accept: application/json

### Create menu item
POST {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gomen Besiga",
  "category": "Main",
  "price": 350
}

### Orders collection
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders
Accept: application/json

### Create order (201 with Location)
POST {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemIds": [1, 2]
}

### Order detail (use the ID returned by POST)
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Update order status
PATCH {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### Route constraint example: 404 because "abc" is not an integer ID
GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/abc
Accept: application/json
